second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the profession of C. Mayer?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 63, \"text\": \"Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"start\": 64, \"end\": 265, \"text\": \"She is particularly known for her portrayal of Erda in Richard Wagner's \\\"Ring Cycle\\\"; a role which she has performed several times at the Bayreuth Festival and recorded on the BBC Legends Record Label.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"start\": 266, \"end\": 331, \"text\": \"Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"start\": 332, \"end\": 490, \"text\": \"After graduating from the Bavarian Academy of Singing, she pursued further studies at the Munich Academy of Music where she was a pupil of tenor Thomas Moser.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"start\": 491, \"end\": 644, \"text\": \"She won several notable singing competitions, including prizes in the ARD International Music Competition in Munich and the International Robert Schumann\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 57, \"text\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"start\": 58, \"end\": 175, \"text\": \"She is particularly known for her exceptional skills on the court and has played several times for the national team.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"start\": 176, \"end\": 241, \"text\": \"Christa Mayer was born in Sulzbach-Rosenberg, Germany in Bavaria.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"start\": 242, \"end\": 413, \"text\": \"After graduating from the Bavarian Academy of Physical Education, she pursued further training at the Munich Academy of Sports where she was a pupil of coach Thomas Moser.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"start\": 414, \"end\": 590, \"text\": \"She won several notable sports competitions, including prizes in the ARD International Basketball Competition in Munich and the International Robert Schumann Sports Tournament.\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 119, \"text\": \"Constant Mayer Constant Mayer (October 3, 1829 – May 12, 1911) was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 120, \"end\": 155, \"text\": \"Mayer was born in Besançon, France.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 156, \"end\": 178, \"text\": \"The family was Jewish.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 179, \"end\": 335, \"text\": \"He studied in Paris in the École des Beaux-Arts and under Léon Cogniet, and followed his profession in that city until 1854, when he moved to New York City.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 336, \"end\": 457, \"text\": \"Mayer worked as a colorist at the photography studio of Jeremiah Gurney and CD Fredericks, at 340 Broadway, in Manhattan.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"start\": 458, \"end\": 575, \"text\": \"With his own studio, at 1155 Broadway, he became known for his genre or historical paintings based on literature, and\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 133, \"text\": \", he began giving him copper trimmings which were of no use and Mayer considered Wilson to be his first partner and his best friend .\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 134, \"end\": 227, \"text\": \"Wilson remembered that he was impressed with the boy 's good manners and bright personality .\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 228, \"end\": 358, \"text\": \"[ 22 ] Whenever Mayer visited Saint John in later years , he placed flowers on Wilson 's grave , just as he did on his mother 's .\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 359, \"end\": 394, \"text\": \"[ 22 ] I had been to his hometown .\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 395, \"end\": 425, \"text\": \"I knew from whence he sprang .\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 426, \"end\": 453, \"text\": \"He taught himself grammar .\"}, \"D4S7\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 454, \"end\": 481, \"text\": \"He taught himself manners .\"}, \"D4S8\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d03\", \"start\": 482, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"If anybody\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"answer\": \"German operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\", \"answer\": \"professional basketball player\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Constant Mayer was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\", \"answer\": \"French painter\", \"quote\": \"Constant Mayer Constant Mayer (October 3, 1829 – May 12, 1911) was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"German operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"German professional basketball player\", \"French painter\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"German operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"German professional basketball player\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"French painter\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"colorist\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C4\", \"answer\": \"photography studio worker\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C5\", \"answer\": \"painter\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C6\", \"answer\": \"genre painter\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C7\", \"answer\": \"historical painter\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C8\", \"answer\": \"studio owner\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C9\", \"answer\": \"operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C10\", \"answer\": \"basketball player\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C11\", \"answer\": \"pupil of tenor Thomas Moser\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"i